{"code":200,"message":"success","data":[{"id":201196,"name":"鱿鱼游戏3 2K","descs":"　　奇勋坚持自己终结这场游戏的目标，但负责人继续他的下一步行动，而幸存的玩家们在每一轮做出的选择都将带来更严重的后果。全世界都在翘首以盼导演黄东赫编导的大结局，他誓要为这个史诗般的故事画上圆满的句号。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2meX1nMdScFOoV4370rqHWKmXhY.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2meX1nMdScFOoV4370rqHWKmXhY.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/inoYYVS8vn6LWo4NRqatVfboYTV.jpg","type2":"动作冒险/悬疑/剧情","rating":7.9,"release":"2021-09-17"},{"id":201195,"name":"甜蜜家园3 2K","descs":"　　怪物和人类的界限变得模糊，世界即将毁灭，人类由此面临艰难抉择。在欲望的碰撞之下，殊死对抗随之展开。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mceCXNTny6a5F3rQgShLoyARw4l.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mceCXNTny6a5F3rQgShLoyARw4l.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/znjpEBhHaBetSo51YZTip0FHkiN.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy/动作冒险","rating":8.2,"release":"2024-07-14"},{"id":201194,"name":"甜蜜家园2 2K","descs":"　　是谁在敲门？怪物、人还是半兽半人？界线开始变得模糊，没有人能够逃过感染，大家的处境比以往时候都要危险。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mceCXNTny6a5F3rQgShLoyARw4l.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mceCXNTny6a5F3rQgShLoyARw4l.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fYqxFO90SG6sV2QqXDCxEQE08UM.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy/动作冒险","rating":8.2,"release":"2023-12-01"},{"id":201186,"name":"林肯律师4 2K","descs":"　　《林肯律师》第 4 季已于 2026 年 02 月 05 日 首播。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/womrBbu5fAoa9sUG55gpKBgzbb2.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/womrBbu5fAoa9sUG55gpKBgzbb2.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nuQj6KoM5UzNKrhWVuvFie3aLA.jpg","type2":"剧情/犯罪","rating":7.7,"release":"2026-02-05"},{"id":201185,"name":"林肯律师3 2K","descs":"　　米奇接下一桩牵涉私人因素且具有潜在危险的案件，而他此时正在为被控谋杀好友兼前客户格洛丽亚·代顿的凶手担任辩护律师。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUlzM6k5R6Ki4gUd1R3NiYABIw1.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lUlzM6k5R6Ki4gUd1R3NiYABIw1.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fovrX6M1SMjDQUWKkZbgAIp0m8f.jpg","type2":"剧情/犯罪","rating":7.7,"release":"2024-10-17"},{"id":201184,"name":"林肯律师2 2K","descs":"　　律所业务繁忙，团队忙得不可开交。此时米奇遇见了潜在的新欢，并又接下一桩备受瞩目的案子。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7IssRqPolB6o4PWkuh01vlk1B9.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/r7IssRqPolB6o4PWkuh01vlk1B9.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oFWXpLQkDTSpT2h9xlxy07XOff7.jpg","type2":"剧情/犯罪","rating":7.7,"release":"2023-07-06"},{"id":201183,"name":"林肯律师1 2K","descs":"　　洛杉矶精英辩护律师米奇·哈勒开着他标志性的林肯车，在刑事司法系统穿梭游走：他会不惜一切代价打赢官司。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pahpTmqzUbE1MmdkJmFC7JZyjht.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pahpTmqzUbE1MmdkJmFC7JZyjht.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tCMJFL5KcGlfd3c3ytnBrZ3cpmf.jpg","type2":"剧情/犯罪","rating":7.7,"release":"2022-05-13"},{"id":201179,"name":"天盛长歌 2K","descs":"　　天盛王朝逆境皇子宁弈和前朝皇族遗孤凤知微，一个是城府深藏的亲王，一个 是初露锋芒的官场新秀，两人在风云诡变的朝堂里彼此试探、频频过招，相互排斥却又不自禁相互吸引。而当彼此的心渐渐向对方敞开，邂逅的却是命运彻骨的森凉。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbjsR9aqfyqBS2cVubeHslEkoni.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wbjsR9aqfyqBS2cVubeHslEkoni.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uMGTCEK8DPzBU7EuUuj4pnCzCNc.jpg","type2":"剧情","rating":8.0,"release":"2018-08-14"},{"id":201178,"name":"漠风吟 2K","descs":"　　大漠中三城鼎立，时局动荡，纷争不断。大漠第一美女，没落族裔的公主皇北霜阴差阳错成为厄娜泣和亲使者，前往云沛城和亲。途中与大漠三个呼风唤雨的男人产生交集，一女三男彼此试探玩弄，反骨黑莲花与大漠三强们的相爱相杀。皇北霜不甘被命运捉弄，凭借机智勇敢与坚定信念，在危机四伏的大漠立定脚跟并与北境领主霍擎云互生情愫。惊鸿美人，大漠一梦，在亦真亦幻的危机中逐鹿大漠搅动风云。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3a73AEkYhKabV2q2jXh4tNtsbun.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3a73AEkYhKabV2q2jXh4tNtsbun.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bmyY2t0JZp7Y9K9Be0Jg0oSYRQP.jpg","type2":"剧情","rating":7.6,"release":"2024-09-29"},{"id":100869,"name":"新进职员姜会长 2KY","descs":"　　改编自同名网路小说，讲述被誉为「商业之神」的顶尖大企业——崔成集团会长「姜龙浩」（孙贤周 饰），因一场意外而被迫开启「人生第二回」，展开一段重新审视自我的「重启人生」故事。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxOsQE8UrifZpQ9hcZ7xjMHEbmn.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nxOsQE8UrifZpQ9hcZ7xjMHEbmn.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/j4HpgSdpRW61cDMeRhz31h24Kps.jpg","type2":"剧情/Sci-Fi & Fantasy","rating":8.1,"re